ke my request, hope you would have fun drawing it!\n\nI would like you to draw my black dragon in a theme with matching background that you are good at! Preferably it will be related to traditional Japanese culture and with his feet shown! Feel free to dress him whatever you like, and you don't need to draw his wings.\n\nReference:\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1c0IheGIWbUiR-08oiXfG-jXPZvv3tS6j?usp=drive_link\n\nThank you so much!", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@susanowo2311/works/28", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/9fefe840/uploads/origins/340afd6c-a2e4-4ee8-9138-ec7194e9803d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=54bbf6edcac77c70b2ea8e61309a9cb0", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/9fefe840/uploads/origins/340afd6c-a2e4-4ee8-9138-ec7194e9803d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=54bbf6edcac77c70b2ea8e61309a9cb0, https://si.imgix.net/9fefe840/uploads/origins/340afd6c-a2e4-4ee8-9138-ec7194e9803d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=dafdedf9ac8af1d37b083a837afec9a7 2x, https://si.imgix.net/9fefe840/uploads/origins/340afd6c-a2e4-4ee8-9138-ec7194e9803d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=f7826ae990a6e2a778c2e9b637018836 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "いつる様、いつもツイッターの出雲神話シリーズのイラストを拝見させていただいております。\n自身のファーソナである狼獣人「宗次狼」が、道場であぐらをかき、愛刀の手入れをしている様子をイラストにしていただけないでしょうか。\nイメージとしては、いつる様がツイッターに上げられていたような感じです。\nhttps://x.com/susanowo2311/status/1559118604540338177?s=20\n\n各種SNS等の宗次狼の個人活動で使用させていただきたいと思います。\nよろしくご検討ください。\n\nhttps://www.dropbox.com/scl/fi/7tu26tvs2iholej3x4mj0/_20231001s.pptx?rlkey=2fpog83bxvlvv6j6wz62plda9&dl=0", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@susanowo2311/works/27", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/258b0b2d/uploads/origins/a2e10831-849b-485b-897b-1a30d76182ba?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=0